Job Description:
Job description
Betty Blocks is redefining how enterprise software gets built. As an AI Application Generation platform, we help organizations create powerful applications without vendor lock-in, without giving up code ownership, and without the speed penalty of traditional development.

What you will be doing
As DevOps Cloud Engineer at Betty Blocks, you and the DevOps team are responsible for the development process of our AI-app generation platform. You develop and maintain the infrastructure in-and-around our innovative platform in Azure or on premise at our clients.

At Betty Blocks we run a large number of Kubernetes clusters driven with Helm Charts in a CI/CD pipeline. We already have a serious setup, but we are constantly expanding it.

As one of the leading AI-app generation platforms in the world, Betty Blocks offers a complex, challenging and dynamic environment where it is your challenge to support our energetic growth. An excellent scalable platform is of great importance to maintain our momentum.

To ensure the development and release processes keep running smoothly, you support our Betty Blocks development teams by monitoring our applications and kubernetes clusters, managing our data and security, and visualizing possible bottlenecks.

Our AI-app generation platform offers different kinds of developers the possibility to develop applications without boundaries. It's your responsibility to ensure our platform keeps running smoothly, despite peaks of thousands of applications that run simultaneously, without our end users experiencing any drops in performance.

You need to bring
You have a passion for digital technique and at least 3 years of experience in a DevOps oriented position;
You have experience with cloud platforms (preferably Microsoft Azure);
You have experience with Docker, Kubernetes, OpenShift and MySQL;
Experience with setting up and improving CI/CD pipelines;
You have experience with automation, streamlining processes and reducing manual work wherever possible;
You have experience with Enterprise On-Prem Solutions, enabling and supporting our customers on the deploy process;
You are comfortable and experienced using AI, both as a tool in your own workflow and in supporting AI-driven platform capabilities;
You like to closely cooperate with the team to ensure our platform keeps running smoothly and clients have the ultimate experience.

What do we offer?
Besides a monthly salary based on your personal profile and experience we offer the following:

An open and informal working atmosphere;
Celebrate successes with Friday afternoon drinks, a quarterly Buffalo celebration with drinks and unique Betty Blocks festivals.
A new, Google-like office building near the city center and Alkmaar station;
Full travel allowance;
Option to partially work from home: An office-first culture with a couple of work-from-home days a week, in a modern office near Alkmaar station.
A lease bicycle plan;
25 paid days off per year;
Every day a fully catered (healthy) lunch buffet and fresh fruit at every department;
A pension plan;
Professional chair massages in the office;
Use our in-house gym for free and exercise with a personal trainer at a discount!
Strengthen your mental well-being with the Evermood platform.
Friendly, ambitious and diverse teams.



